{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"litharness","tool":"litharness_command","arguments":{"arguments":["world","summary"]},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"call\": 2, \"returncode\": 0, \"stdout\": \"{\\r\\n  \\\"records\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"canon\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"proposed\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"replaced\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"rules\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"criteria\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"capabilities\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"cast\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"open_questions\\\": 0,\\r\\n  \\\"check\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"complaints\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"ok\\\": true,\\r\\n    \\\"gaps\\\": [\\r\\n      \\\"no accepted status_snapshot whose value is an object, so nothing in this book can state where anybody stands as a number and no scene will be asked to. `world vocabulary` has the shape; `world accept` is what makes it count\\\",\\r\\n      \\\"this book declares no game system: no subject holds the system role with a magnitude scale and a governed ordinal ladder. Its sheet is whatever was seeded by hand, its numbers have no home, and a progression beat has no vocabulary to land in.\\\"\\r\\n    ],\\r\\n    \\\"grown\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"would_not_finish\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"would_breach\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"snapshot_faults\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"machinery_names\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"will_not_resolve\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"manifested\\\": 0,\\r\\n    \\\"needing_manifestation\\\": 0,\\r\\n    \\\"unmanifested\\\": [],\\r\\n    \\\"unplaceable\\\": []\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\", \"stderr\": \"\"}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll build the starting world and its skill system, leaving the planned rescues, acquisitions and meetings unperformed. Owen will start at Slot Rank 1 with no installed skills.\n\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"litharness","tool":"litharness_command","arguments":{"arguments":["world","declare-batch","--records","[{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"entity_role\",\"value\":\"system\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"is_a\",\"value\":\"Slot System\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"world_rule\",\"value\":\"The Slot System grants specific magical permissions through installed skills. Every person receives exactly one Slot. Ordinary capacity is one installed skill; replacing it releases the old magic, not memory or mundane expertise. Reacquiring a released skill requires another source. No class grants extra skills.\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"manifests_as\",\"value\":\"Still white lettering on a faint charcoal field appears in personal vision without a voice. At Earth's arrival active phones, tills and televisions echo: EVERY PERSON HAS RECEIVED ONE SLOT. CHOOSE WHAT YOU WILL BE ABLE TO DO.\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"type\",\"value\":\"criterion\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"is_a\",\"value\":\"Slot Rank\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"comparator\",\"value\":\"ordinal\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"governed_by\",\"object\":\"slot_system\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"world_rule\",\"value\":\"Installation earns no advancement. First successful control under real environmental demand, materially harder applications and genuinely new combinations earn progress. Easy repetition stops contributing; sustained practice can prepare harder feats. There are no fixed advancement quotas. Higher Slot Rank increases installed skills' strength and endurance, not their magical functions. Eight rungs describe the locally attested span, not a final ceiling.\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_1\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_2\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_2\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_3\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_3\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_4\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_4\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_5\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_5\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_6\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_6\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_7\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_7\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_8\"},{\"subject\":\"owen\",\"predicate\":\"entity_role\",\"value\":\"protagonist\"},{\"subject\":\"owen\",\"predicate\":\"is_a\",\"value\":\"Owen Price\"},{\"subject\":\"owen\",\"predicate\":\"stands_at\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_1\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"status_sheet\",\"value\":{\"system\":\"slot_system\",\"show_unheld\":false}},{\"subject\":\"owen\",\"predicate\":\"status_snapshot\",\"value\":{\"rank\":1}},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"graph_line\",\"value\":{\"label\":\"Slot System\",\"edges\":[{\"predicate\":\"stands_at\",\"phrase\":\"Slot Rank\"}]}},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"world_rule\",\"value\":\"Starter selection offers Cling, Anchor or Kindle without a physical source. Later skills have tangible sources: touching an intact source identifies its permission without commitment; taking it consumes that source. Skills are retained through ordinary use and failed practice, not spent as fuel. Injury or lost equipment does not remove earned ranks or retained skills.\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"manifests_as\",\"value\":\"Personal sheets silently show name, Slot count, capacity, installed skills and Slot Rank. Owen's first personal sheet reads OWEN PRICE; SLOT COUNT: 1; SLOT CAPACITY: UNLIMITED; INSTALLED SKILLS: NONE; SLOT RANK: 1. Ordinary people's capacity line reads SLOT CAPACITY: 1. Relevant lines update quietly.\"}]"]},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"litharness","tool":"litharness_command","arguments":{"arguments":["world","declare-batch","--records","[{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"entity_role\",\"value\":\"system\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"is_a\",\"value\":\"Slot System\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"world_rule\",\"value\":\"The Slot System grants specific magical permissions through installed skills. Every person receives exactly one Slot. Ordinary capacity is one installed skill; replacing it releases the old magic, not memory or mundane expertise. Reacquiring a released skill requires another source. No class grants extra skills.\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_system\",\"predicate\":\"manifests_as\",\"value\":\"Still white lettering on a faint charcoal field appears in personal vision without a voice. At Earth's arrival active phones, tills and televisions echo: EVERY PERSON HAS RECEIVED ONE SLOT. CHOOSE WHAT YOU WILL BE ABLE TO DO.\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"type\",\"value\":\"criterion\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"is_a\",\"value\":\"Slot Rank\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"comparator\",\"value\":\"ordinal\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"governed_by\",\"object\":\"slot_system\"},{\"subject\":\"slot_rank\",\"predicate\":\"world_rule\",\"value\":\"Installation earns no advancement. First successful control under real environmental demand, materially harder applications and genuinely new combinations earn progress. Easy repetition stops contributing; sustained practice can prepare harder feats. There are no fixed advancement quotas. Higher Slot Rank increases installed skills' strength and endurance, not their magical functions. Eight rungs describe the locally attested span, not a final ceiling.\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_1\",\"predicate\":\"precedes\",\"value\":\"slot_rank\",\"object\":\"rank_2\"},{\"subject\":\"rank_2\",\"pr